eld_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Steps to reproduce:\r\n\r\n1. Download this 18-second video - https://uloz.to/file/DRkfa60ecVdz/aircraft-mts . \r\n2. Open a new project in Shotcut, leave video mode on automatic, no proxy.\r\n3. Drag the downloaded `aircraft.MTS` directly to the timeline.\r\n4. Right click the clip on the Timeline -> click `More` -> `Detach audio`. Shotcut creates an A1 audio track and puts the detached audio in it.\r\n5. In the Properties tab, click `Convert` button to get the \"Convert to Edit-friendly\" dialogue, leave the \"Better\" option and save the converted clip. Shotcut creates `aircraft - Converted.mov` and replaces the original clip on the timeline with the new one.\r\n6. Play the timeline. The video is black now.\r\n7. The same behavior occurs with an MP4 from different camera brand.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9153595/102775740-b91bf900-438d-11eb-87eb-1f98e9b16d6b.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nWindows 10 Pro, version 2004\r\nShotcut 20.11.28","closed_by":{"login":"ddennedy","id":1146683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDY2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1146683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddennedy","html_url":"https://github.com/ddennedy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddennedy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddennedy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddennedy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddennedy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddennedy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddennedy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddennedy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddennedy/event